		(uuid "e2045570-5fdf-5229-b818-ab488ac1551e")
	)
	(text "TPS5430, 500 kHz, all-ceramic output: needs the external\ncompensation R10/C14/C15/C16 (TI SLVS632, Fig. 7-11 method).\nVout = 1.221 V x (1 + R8/R9) = 12.3 V.  L1 15 uH, Isat 4 A.\nOutput: 4 x 22 uF 25 V (~35 uF at 12 V); LC = 6.9 kHz.\nLoss ~2.5 W at 3 A: thermal vias under U3, copper on D4/L1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 35.56 0)
		(effects
